<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Summary of Australian markets 1995/96 - AFMA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Summary of Australian markets 1995/96 - AFMA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a summary of the turnover in Australia's major financial markets in the year to June 30, 1996 released in a report by the Australian Financial Markets Association (AFMA).</p>
<p> MARKET			AMT (A$ BLN) PCT CHANGE ON 94/95</p>
<p> All (inc non-major)	 27,051	     -3.0</p>
<p>Exchange Traded markets</p>
<p> Equities			   159	     35.0</p>
<p> Futures			  6,623	     -7.0</p>
<p>OTC Financial markets</p>
<p> Foreign Exchange	    15,207		1.0</p>
<p> Currency Options		 222	     12.0</p>
<p> Long-dated Securities	1,172	    -25.0</p>
<p> Repurchase Agreements	1,484	     -1.0</p>
<p> Short-dated Instruments    1,113	     14.0</p>
<p> FRA's				664	    -35.0</p>
<p> Swaps				349	     10.0</p>
<p> Interest Rate Options	   58	     -3.0</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
